\cf2\lang4105\f0{\pntext\f5\'B7\tab}Shaft Encoder counter within the metadata was skipping a line between the 1st and 2nd line.\cf0\lang1033\f3\par
\cf2\lang4105\f0{\pntext\f5\'B7\tab}Aborting the grab could cause the End of Transfer event to not occur (LogViewer would show 'No EOT' Error). A reset of the board would be needed to be able to acquire again. \cf0\lang1033\f3\par
